line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Zavistic Rarve</col> again to get a cut scene.</col>
step	21	-	Quick guide step 21
line	<str>Talk to Bert in Yanille, in the house next to the POH Portal to get a Sandy hand.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Dragon Inn pub south of Bert's house. Buy a beer from the bartender (if you don't have one) and give the beer to the Guard Captain.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ring the bell at the Wizards' Guild (outside near eastern doors), or enter the guild with 66 Magic, then talk to Zavistic Rarve, who will take the Hand. If started Zogre Flesh Eaters:</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Bert to get Bert's rota.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Brimhaven and find Sandy in a small house south of The Shrimp and Parrot restaurant and north-west of the pub.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search Sandy's desk to get Sandy's rota.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pickpocket Sandy until you get sand.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel back to Yanille and talk to Bert to receive a magic scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ring the bell just outside the Wizards' Guild and talk to Zavistic Rarve again to receive a magical orb.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Zavistic Rarve again. He will offer to teleport you to Port Sarim. ( if started Zogre Flesh Eaters)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Betty in Port Sarim Magic shop for a bottled water.</str>
line	
line	<str>First add redberries, then white berries to the bottled water in order to get a pink dye.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dye the lantern lens to get a rose-tinted lens.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Betty again so she puts the vial on the counter.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go stand in the doorway and "use" the lens on the counter to get a truth serum.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Betty one last time with sand in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Brimhaven and talk to Sandy.</str>
line	
line	<str>Activate the magical orb and talk to Sandy again. Be sure to click every option.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Yanille and Ring the Bell at the Wizards' Guild to talk to Zavistic Rarve.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Zavistic Rarve again to get a cut scene.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel to <col=800000>Entrana</col> and talk to <col=800000>Mazion</col> at the sandpit to get a <col=800000>Wizard's head</col>.</col>
